#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Suna"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Ba wa wannan asusun suna mai ma'ana da za a nuna."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Sunan mai amfani"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Sunan mai amfani da za a yi amfani da shi don tantancewa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Kalmar sirri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Kalmar sirri da ake amfani da ita don tantancewa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Kunna Kalmar Sirri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Kalmar sirrinka ta Enable, idan ana buƙata."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Kunna Na'ura"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Cire alama a wannan akwatin don hana yin ajiyar baya ga wannan na'ura."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Bayani"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Sunan wannan na'ura (za a yi amfani da shi wajen ajiye saiti da SVN idan babu sunan mai masauki a cikin saitin)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Adireshin IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Wannan shine Adireshin IP da ake amfani da shi don sadarwa da na'ura."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "Uwar Garken TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Sabar TFTP ta zaɓi da wannan na'ura ke kwafar saitinta zuwa gare ta. Bar shi fanko don amfani da saitin Sabar TFTP na gama-gari."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Mabuɗin Mai Masauki na SSH da Aka Ajiye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Kwatanta wannan tsarin maɓallin mai masauki da sawun yatsar SHA-1 hex tare da na'urar ta hanyar da aka amince da ita. A kan uwar garke, maye gurbin hanyar da ke ƙasa da fayil ɗin maɓallin mai masauki na jama'a da ya dace sannan ka gudanar da: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Yi amfani da aikin na'urar don share shi bayan halastaccen canjin maɓalli."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Jagorar Fayiloli"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne tsarin babban fayil na dangantaka da ake amfani da shi wajen adana saitunan."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Nau'in Jadawali"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Sau nawa za a yi Ajiyar baya ga wannan na'ura. Kullum tare da Sake Gudu Kowace 10 yana yin ajiyar baya kowane kwana 10; Kowane Wata yana yin cikakkiyar ajiyar baya ta kalandar wata."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Sake Gudanarwa Kowanne"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Don tsare-tsaren lokaci na Kullum, sake gudanar da madadin ajiya duk bayan kwanaki X. Don tsare-tsaren lokaci na Mako-mako ba tare da takamaiman Ranaku na Mako ba, sake gudanar da shi duk bayan makonni X; da zarar an zaɓi Ranaku na Mako, madadin ajiya zai riƙa gudana a waɗannan ranakun kowane mako kuma wannan filin ba zai yi aiki ba."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Kwanakin Mako"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Don tsarin lokaci na Mako-mako, ranar(ranakun) mako da za a gudanar da madadin ajiya a kai, kowane mako. Bar shi fanko don gudanarwa a kowane makonni na Sake Gudanarwa Duk Bayan a maimakon haka."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Watannin Shekara"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Don tsarin lokaci na Wata-wata, watan(watannin) shekara da za a gudanar da madadin ajiya a ciki."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Kwanakin Wata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Don tsarin lokaci na Wata-wata, ranar(ranakun) wata da za a gudanar da madadin ajiya a kai (Ƙarshe = ranar ƙarshe ta wata)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Makonni na Wata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Don tsarin lokaci na Wata-wata a Rana, mako(nni) na wata da za a gudanar da madadin ajiya a ciki."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Kwanakin Mako (Kowane Wata)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Don tsarin lokaci na Wata-wata a Rana, ranar(ranakun) mako da za a haɗa da zaɓin Makonnin Wata."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Device Type"
msgstr "Nau'in Na'ura"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the type of device that the router is."
msgstr "Zaɓi nau'in na'urar da wannan na'urar raba sadarwa (router) take."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Gano da Kansa"

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Connection Type"
msgstr "Nau'in Haɗi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne nau'in haɗin da ake amfani da shi don sadarwa da na'urar."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Authentication Account"
msgstr "Asusun Tabbatar da Shaida"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose an account to use to Login to the router"
msgstr "Zaɓi asusun da za a yi amfani da shi don Shiga cikin na'urar raba sadarwa (router)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Babu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar lokaci na asali"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to wait in seconds for a response"
msgstr "Lokacin jira na asali a cikin daƙiƙu don samun amsa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default sleep time"
msgstr "Lokacin dakatawa na asali"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to sleep in microseconds (1/1,000,000th of a second)"
msgstr "Lokacin dakatawa na asali a cikin mayikurosakan (1/1,000,000 na daƙiƙa)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "Ɗauka yana da babban iko"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Yi alama a wannan akwatin don ɗauka cewa wannan na'urar tana da matsayi mai girma a kodayaushe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Sunan wannan nau'in na'ura."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Alamar Sunan mai amfani"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne saƙon neman sunan mai amfani da za a daidaita yayin shiga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Tambayar Kalmar Sirri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne saƙon neman kalmar sirri da za a daidaita yayin shiga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin tsarin saiti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Wannan shi ne wurin da aka saba ajiye fayil ɗin saiti a kan na'urar nesa. Ana amfani da shi don hanyar SCP da SFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Kwafi TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Wannan shine rubutun CLI da ake amfani da shi don aika ajiyar bayanai (backup) zuwa sabar tftp."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Umarnin Ɗaukar Bayani"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Umarni na zaɓi wanda ake ajiye sakamakonsa a matsayin saiti, maimakon kwafa shi zuwa sabar TFTP. Koyaushe yana gudana ta SSH, komai Nau'in Haɗin, kuma na'urar ba ta buƙatar sabar TFTP. Bar shi fanko don na'urorin da ke kwafar saitinsu zuwa TFTP. Misali don MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Nuna Siga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Wannan shine rubutun CLI da ake amfani da shi don nuna sigar yanzu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Tambayar Tabbatarwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Wannan shine saƙon tabbatarwa da za a daidaita kafin aikawa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Tabbatar"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Shin akwai tambayar tabbatarwa don kwafin saitin?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Tilasta Tabbatarwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Shin akwai tambayar tabbatarwa ta tilas don kwafin saitin?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Duba Ƙarshe a Cikin Tsari"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "A duba ƙarshe a cikin tsari?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Saƙon Kowane Maɓalli"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Rubutu da zai dace da saƙon neman izini irin na 'Press Any Key To Continue'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Saƙonnin Bayan Shiga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Nau'i-nau'in tambaya/amsa na zaɓi da ake aikawa nan da nan bayan shiga, kafin umarnin kwafa zuwa TFTP, ɗaya a kowane layi kamar prompt|response. Ana daidaita tambayar a matsayin regular expression mara bambancin manyan ko ƙananan haruffa da sakamakon na'urar (don haka ba za ta iya ƙunsar | da kanta ba, kuma dole ne a kuɓutar da maƙalai da sauran haruffa na musamman, misali Save \\\\[y/n\\\\]), kuma ana aika amsar kamar yadda aka rubuta ta, ko a yi amfani da <CR> don aika dawowar layi kawai. Ana aika amsa ne kawai da zarar an ga tambayarta, ko dai a cikin amsar tambayar baya ko a cikin sakamako na gaba; in ba haka ba ana rubuta gargaɗi a rajista kuma ba a aika komai. Ana amsa waɗannan da farko; ana amsa tambayar Any Key da ke sama daga baya, yayin da ake kunna na'urar, don haka tambayar da aka amsa a nan ba ta taɓa kaiwa ga Any Key ba. Misali: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Gabaɗaya"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Yanayin Gabatarwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Shin ya kamata a nuna Router Configs a kan Console ko a Shafin Sama."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Kansul"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Tab na Sama"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Layukan Mahallin Bambancin Saiti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Tsohon adadin layukan da ba su canza ba da za a nuna kafin da bayan kowane canji yayin kwatanta ajiyar baya guda biyu. Babbar ƙima tana sauƙaƙa ganin yanayin tsarin da ke kewaye. Ana iya soke wannan ga kowane kwatanci a shafin Kwatanta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Lokacin haɗi ya ƙare"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Mafi tsawon lokacin jira a daƙiƙa lokacin kafa haɗin sadarwa na farko zuwa Na'ura. Ana barin Na'ura da ta rataye ko ba a iya samunta bayan wannan ƙarewar lokaci domin shirin ajiyar bayanai ya ci gaba da sauran Na'urori."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Rufe ba tare da fita ba"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Idan an yi masa alama, yayin rufe haɗin na'ura, ba za a fitar da umarnin 'exit' ba"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Ma'adanin Wucin-gadi na Gano Kuskuren Haɗi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Ko a rubuta sakamakon haɗin na'ura kai tsaye a rajista"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Ɗauka duk na'urori suna da babban iko"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Ko a ɗauka cewa dukkan na'urori suna da babban matsayi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Sa'ar Saukewa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Sa'ar rana da za a gudanar da cikakken saukarwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Tsarin Lokacin Sake Gwadawa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Lokacin da za a jira kafin a yi ƙoƙarin yin ƙarin saukarwa lokacin da saukarwar da aka tsara ta gaza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Lokacin Riƙewa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Adadin kwanakin da za a adana tsofaffin ajiyayyun bayanai."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Ajiye Ajiyar Bayanan Na'ura Mara Aiki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, tsaftacewar ajiya ba za ta share tsofaffin madadin bayanai na na'urori da aka kashe ko na na'urori da aka cire ba, don haka za a riƙe saitunan kayan aikin da aka daina amfani da su ko waɗanda ba za a iya isa gare su ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Canjawa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Nau'in haɗi na asali"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Nau'in haɗi na asali da ake amfani da shi wajen sadarwa da na'ura."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Raba Ta Na'ura"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Raba Saitunan da aka ajiye zuwa babban fayil ɗaya ga kowace na'ura"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Ƙaramin Jaka Mai Kwanan Wata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Saka ƙaramin babban fayil mai tushen kwanan wata a cikin hanyar ajiya (kafin babban fayil na kowace na'ura), ta yadda za a adana kowane aiki ƙarƙashin kwanan watan ajiyarsa, misali .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Kashewa tana kiyaye tsarin da ke akwai."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Hanyar SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Lokacin amfani da SCP, barin wannan fanko zai yi amfani da tsarin SCP na PHP wanda ba koyaushe yake aiki ba. An kashe SCP na waje yayin da aka kunna tabbatar da maɓallin mai masauki na SSH saboda ba zai iya sake amfani da haɗin da aka tabbatar ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Tabbatar da Maɓallan Mai Masauki na SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
