#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Haɗa Bambance-bambancen Saiti"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Ƙara haɗaɗɗen bambanci (unified diff) na kowace na'ura da tsarinta ya canza yayin gudanarwa zuwa Imel ɗin ajiya, ta yadda mai dubawa zai ga ainihin abin da ya canza. Ana tsallake tsare-tsaren binary (waɗanda ba rubutu ba). Layuka masu sauyawa a kowane ajiya (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' da 'Current configuration :', da NX-OS '!Time:' da '!Running configuration last done at:') koyaushe ana watsi da su. Gargaɗi: ana aika bambancin a rubutu bayyananne ga kowane mai karɓar Imel ɗin, don haka zai iya tona tsarin da ya kamata ya kasance a asirce; bar Haɗa Sirri a Cikin Bambance-bambance ba tare da an zaɓa ba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Haɗa Sirrika a cikin Bambance-bambance"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Aika ƙimomin sirri a cikin bambancin (diff) da aka aika ta imel kamar yadda suke. Idan ba a yi masa alama ba (na asali), ana gano layukan da suka sauya a cikin ɗanyen saitin kuma a buga su a ɓoye, ta hanyar rufewa idan akwai shakka: layukan da ke ɗauke da kalmomi masu kama da sirri (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) da layukan mai masauki da mai amfani na SNMP ana rage su zuwa kalmarsu ta farko sannan &lt;secret hidden&gt; ya biyo baya, kuma kowane layi na gungu na PEM, takardar shaida ko gungun mabuɗin rubutu, ko ƙimar da aka sa a cikin alamun zance mai layuka da yawa, da kowane layin hex ko base64, ana ɓoye su; gungun da bai ƙare ba yana ɓoye sauran saitin. Wannan kuma yana ɓoye layukan da ba su da illa (misali bayani da ya ambaci key), amma duk layin da ya sauya zai ci gaba da bayyana, an yi masa alamar (changed) idan ɓangarensa da aka ɓoye kawai ya bambanta, kuma ana ambaton gungun da bai ƙare ba a cikin Imel. Ba a taɓa canza ajiyayyun madadin bayanai."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Tsarin Keɓewa na Bambanci (Diff)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Regular expressions na zaɓi (ɗaya a kowane layi) da suka dace da layukan saiti da za a yi watsi da su yayin kwatantawa, don layuka masu sauyawa kamar tambarin lokaci ko lambobin seri ba za su bayyana a matsayin sauye-sauye ba. Ana daidaita kowane tsari ba tare da la'akari da manyan ko ƙananan haruffa ba a ko'ina cikin layi sai dai idan an kafa shi da ^ ko $; ana yin watsi da tsarin da ba ingantaccen regular expression ba ne."

#: includes/arrays.php
